                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Hwy 401 and Allen Road: a Study"
                  }
                ],
                "level": 2
              },
              {
                "type": "richText",
                "role": "body",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "This project focuses on the pedestrian experience at the intersection of Highway 401 and Allen Road. It highlights the lack of pedestrian-friendly routes for crossing the area and examines the accessibility of the underpasses and sidewalks. The project concludes with a proposal for a footbridge over a section of the highway, along with additional modifications to enhance convenience and safety for pedestrians."
                  }
